WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.833
The flat tool at the mouth of the keyway takes up the play in the plug. Here the middle wafer meets the wall of the groove first.

00:00:00.833 --> 00:00:02.500
The hook lifts the front wafer against its spring. The wafer follows the hook back down.

00:00:02.500 --> 00:00:03.333
The middle wafer rubs against the groove as the hook lifts it. The extra resistance comes from the turning tool pressing the wafer sideways.

00:00:03.333 --> 00:00:04.250
When the tip clears the groove, the turning tool moves a little farther. The housing now sits under the tip and holds the wafer up as the hook leaves.

